            "line": 496,
            "text": "theorem past_add_future {a b M : ℝ} {v : E} {f : ℝ × E → F}\n    (hf : Continuous f) (hs : RadialAlias.RadiallySupported a b f) (z : ℝ × E) :\n    pastIntegral M v f z + futureIntegral M v f z = totalIntegral M v f z"
